OL,3,GNEWSAPre-school told to make urgent
OL,4,Aimprovements
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pre-school in Leicester has been told
OL,7,Fto improve its children's welfare and
OL,8,Fleadership following an inspection by
OL,9,FOfsted.
OL,11,FUnhealthy lunches, inconsistent
OL,12,Fteaching and leadership and staffing
OL,13,Ffailures were among the concerns raised
OL,14,Fduring a visit by the education
OL,15,Fwatchdog to Little Adventurers Pre
OL,16,FSchool, based at the New Parks
OL,17,FAdventure Playground in Glenfield.
OL,19,FFollowing the inspection on October 13,
OL,20,Fthe pre-school was also told to improve
OL,21,Fits achievement and curriculum and to
OL,22,Festablish better routines for children.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
